          "request": {
            "name": "Check HTTP Server and Database Status",
            "description": {
              "content": "This endpoint returns a HTTP 200 status code when Ory Hydra is up running and the environment dependencies (e.g.\nthe database) are responsive as well.\n\nIf the service supports TLS Edge Termination, this endpoint does not require the\n`X-Forwarded-Proto` header to be set.\n\nBe aware that if you are running multiple nodes of Ory Hydra, the health status will never\nrefer to the cluster state, only to a single instance.",
